Name: nfsuserd
Description: load user and group information into the kernel for NFSv4 services plus support manage-gids for all NFS versions
URL: https://man.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=nfsuserd&manpath=FreeBSD+15.0-RELEASE
Version: 15.0
License: NOASSERTION
Source: https://cgit.freebsd.org/src/tree/usr.sbin/nfsuserd?h=stable/15
Requires: lib.csu \
	lib.libc \
	lib.libcompiler_rt
